The public S1 model has training lineage from 2M-Flores-ASL, FLEURS-ASL, FSboard,
and Taskmaster-1. The sealed release includes the reviewed license copy and exact
attribution companion for each source. Those source-specific companions are the
authoritative attribution notices for this release.

This repository and its release assets contain no source videos, source annotations,
derived source records, or FSboard records. The MediaPipe Holistic task model is
downloaded separately by operators and is not distributed as a UMI release asset.
